    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617830/extras/3878b5ac656605d2dbfffb5cd4f3e506.avif?t=1736714710\" width=640 height=84 /></span><br><br>Vysions is a first-person puzzle game that explores a series of dreams manifested as 3D worlds.<br><br>Explore unique realms with cryptic machines, enigmatic symbols and riddles to unfold.<br><br><i>&quot;We were alone in a distant void where time had no substance. Then a spark in the mind emerged. Light, thought, and the indecipherable struggles of the other world reaching out as Vysions.&quot;</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617830/extras/3878b5ac656605d2dbfffb5cd4f3e506.avif?t=1736714710\" width=640 height=84 /></span><br><br>Vysions is a first-person puzzle game that explores a series of dreams manifested as 3D worlds.<br><br>Explore unique realms with cryptic machines, enigmatic symbols and riddles to unfold.<br><br><i>&quot;We were alone in a distant void where time had no substance. Then a spark in the mind emerged. Light, thought, and the indecipherable struggles of the other world reaching out as Vysions.&quot;</i>",
